    "Lights.2 restores the original fog sprite edges and anchors the native glove tooltip to its actual button. The glove draws above fog in this mode. Lights Out rules, waves and garden remain unchanged. Earlier minigames, accepted plant artwork, original mode IDs, unlock rules and serialized object layouts are preserved. Full original parity remains unverified.",
